{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dafa2364-e4b0-8ea2-8d89-f895fbac0d27",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T19:26:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine, how can I help you tonight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:23:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good evening, ma'am. Excuse me for calling so late. I know City Hall is closed already, so I call this storm number. My name is Wilson Lopes, at 3 Wellington Avenue, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, that's what this line's for. Three Wellington Avenue, Mr. Lopes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:24:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, three. I am calling to ask about the report I made Sunday. With all respect, the problem is still there. The storm, Friday into Saturday, my basement had water, three inches. We lose boxes, the extra refrigerator, everything wet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:24:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I actually have your address up, and I see a call came in this afternoon too, from your upstairs tenant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Lucille. She called also, because nobody tells us anything. The crew came Monday, I thank them, but they only clean the top, the grate. They shovel a little around and they go. That corner drain was completely buried in leaves, ma'am, the water had nowhere to go. And still, when it rains, it backs up. The same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the crew cleared the grate and the silt around the basin Monday, and it's still backing up. I've got that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. So I ask you, please, when was this drain cleaned before? Properly, I mean. Because to be buried like this, I think many months, maybe years, nobody looks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:25:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning history on my screen here, Mr. Lopes. [pause] What I can do is put that question right on the—"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...somebody who can look under the street, not only the top?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out. Somebody to look under the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:25:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Under. The pipe. Because the top is clean now and still it does not work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:25:41-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It's already flagged for a supervisor to come look at it, from this afternoon. I'm adding your note that you want the line underneath checked, and you're asking when that basin was last cleaned. I don't have a crew date to give you yet, but the supervisor will see both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No date. [pause] Okay. Ma'am, you understand, thirty-five years we are in this house. In summer, weekends, I sit on my stoop and I watch the tourists walk by, I enjoy very much. But now I sit in the basement with a dehumidifier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll mark it as a follow-up so it doesn't sit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:26:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I appreciate. But please, it is not the first time I ask. Somebody must come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's noted, Mr. Lopes. Supervisor review, check under the street, cleaning history. You have a good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T19:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, ma'am. [inaudible] Good night."
    }
  ],
